# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MEDIA BINARIES — video, audio, images (vault policy, 2026-07-23 FC).
# Large, opaque to diff, and never a source format. Principle: track the
# specification that produces the asset, not the asset. Mirrors the vault-root
# .gitignore; replicated into every project repo by the repo-git-nested skill.
#
# NOTE: .gitignore governs only NEW files. Anything already tracked stays
# tracked until explicitly `git rm --cached`-ed.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Video
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.webm
*.wmv
*.m4v
*.mpg
*.mpeg
*.flv
*.3gp
# Audio
*.mp3
*.wav
*.aac
*.flac
*.m4a
*.ogg
*.opus
*.wma
*.aiff
*.aif
# Images
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.bmp
*.tif
*.tiff
*.heic
*.heif
*.avif
*.ico

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# POWERPOINT (vault policy, FC 2026-07-24). Decks are not incremental documents:
# every save rewrites the whole zip, so git stores a fresh opaque blob each time
# and the history carries no usable diff. Mirrors the vault-root .gitignore.
# Governs NEW files only; anything already tracked stays tracked.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pptx
